  "summary_en": "European Commission web page explaining how CEN-CENELEC JTC 21 is developing harmonised standards to implement the EU AI Act for high-risk AI systems. Standards are voluntary but give presumption of conformity once cited in the Official Journal; prEN 18286 (quality management system) entered public enquiry on 30 October 2025.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "CEN and CENELEC JTC 21 develop harmonised standards for high-risk AI in ten areas requested by the Commission.",
   "Application of harmonised standards is voluntary but gives presumption of conformity once referenced in the Official Journal.",
   "prEN 18286 on AI quality management systems (Article 17) entered public enquiry on 30 October 2025.",
   "An 'international first' approach lets ISO/IEC standards, e.g. from SC 42, become European harmonised standards.",
   "Standards are expected to reduce compliance costs and become global benchmarks."
